    "Kalau kalimatnya sulit dipahami, Saku mengirim teksnya saja, tanpa saldo atau nomor rekening. Teks itu tidak disimpan dan tidak dipakai melatih AI.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If a sentence is hard to understand, Saku sends only its text, with no balances or account numbers. That text isn't stored or used to train AI."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kalimat asli": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Original sentence"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kalimat asli langsung dihapus begitu draf jadi. Draf yang tidak kamu proses hilang sendiri setelah 30 hari.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The original sentence is deleted as soon as the draft is made. Drafts you don't handle disappear on their own after 30 days."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kalimat dan notifikasi dibaca langsung di perangkat ini.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sentences and notifications are read right on this device."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kalimat, notifikasi, dan tulisan di gambar dibaca langsung di perangkat ini. Gambarnya tidak disimpan.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sentences, notifications and the text in pictures are read right on this device. Pictures are not kept."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kalimatnya diproses di perangkatmu. Hanya jika kalimat sulit dipahami, teksnya (tanpa saldo atau nomor rekening) dikirim ke server Saku untuk dibantu model bahasa. Penyedia model tidak menyimpan dan tidak melatih model dari teks itu.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sentences are processed on your device. Only if one is hard to understand, its text (without balances or account numbers) is sent to Saku's server for a language model to help. The model provider does not store it or train on it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
