    "Pilihan yang diingat Saku (kata kunci, kategori, dompet, dan berapa kali dipakai) disimpan di server supaya ikut ke perangkat lain. Bukan kalimat aslinya, bukan nominalnya. Mode tamu hanya di perangkat ini.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What Saku remembers (keywords, categories, wallets and how often they were used) is kept on the server so it follows you to other devices. Not your original sentence, not the amount. Guest mode stays on this device only."
          }
        }
      }
    },
